                <mxCell id="66" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;CONSUMER&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The consumer reads the events from kafka and performs aggregation.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;On crash - consumer resumes from last committed offset&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
